+     * The bound that matters for the 64-bit compiler is in
+     * OvercommitTracker::HandleAccessViolation, because on an ARM64EC image the
+     * emulation module's ResetToConsistentState sees the fault first and this
+     * handler is never reached -- see that comment for the measurement. This
